    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n87978" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προμᾰραίνω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>cause to waste away: reduce to nothing,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν φόβον</span> Vett. Val.<i><span class="en">
				355.27
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i>die away first,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				932b33
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σταφυλὴ-μεμαρασμένη</span>
			<i>dried</i> grapes, <i><span class="en">
				Aët.
				12.55
			</span></i>; <i>to be wasted, worn out,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπὸ φόβου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Vett.Val.
					242.2
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				252.27
			</span></i>.</div>
